WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.932
Your Level 2 learners need their own organiser for every

00:00:03.932 --> 00:00:07.450
lesson, and building those pages each week takes hours.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.162
62 printable A4 pages.

00:00:12.182 --> 00:00:16.746
It's for learners aged 8 to 10 (CEFR A1 to A2) following Level

00:00:16.746 --> 00:00:19.544
2 Development with a teacher or tutor.

00:00:20.546 --> 00:00:22.996
190,000 dong per learner.

00:00:22.996 --> 00:00:26.096
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

